    description: ""  # 0eab
    fields:  # 0eab
      rationale: "hypergumbo has FIVE patterns for JSON output across 15 subcommands: (1) '--format text|json': config, test-coverage, dead-code-maybe; (2) '--json' flag: io-boundaries, verify-claims; (3) '--flat' flag: slice; (4) always JSON: run, compact; (5) no JSON: sketch, search, routes, explain, catalog, symbols, cache-status. This extends RRR (catalog), BBB (cache-status), AAAAA (routes) with two more text-only subcmds (symbols, explain) AND highlights the inconsistent flag naming (--format vs --json vs --flat) for the JSON-supporting ones"  # 0eab
